      "text": "RFC 8446 specifies TLS 1.3 as a secure channel designed to prevent eavesdropping, tampering, and forgery; its handshake authenticates peers, negotiates cryptographic parameters and establishes shared keying material, while its record protocol protects traffic using the established parameters.",
